            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.79</h2><ul><li>Improves Companion Realtime Voice with streamed PCM TTS, selectable Companion-advertised TTS voices, dynamic Piper voice discovery, and clearer installed-backend status.</li><li>Adds OpenAI transcription fallback for local STT failures while preserving local-first transcription.</li><li>Publishes runtime capability metadata so VoiceClaw Realtime can show installed local/cloud TTS choices accurately.</li></ul>
]]></description>
